I know what residuals are :) but it is not clear from which model you
took these residuals.  When people talk about residual reading times in
the context of self-paced reading experiments, they typically have a
model that explains RTs as a function of region length in
characters.  However, there are also other ways to residualize that
might make sense depending of the properties of the stimuli.  Perhaps
you could clarify that.

  Titus


